        "TileImage": "$($repository e6b8e082-38a1-4107-ae70-9087037d86b9).Image",
        "Description": "Nicholas &quot;Florida Man&quot; Velmorres and his supplier, Marcus Bellamy, have been using a highly addictive new drug in florida balls to increase revenue. However, accidentally or purposefully, these balls will kill you in daysand spread in minutes. Two joggers local to the area had these to &quot;increase performance&quot;, and a local technician is already experiencing the symptoms. If we do not act in the next 15 minutes, the virus will spread faster the Black Death. The clock is ticking, 47.\r\rShkerrrr-",
